    jsonb_build_object('number',30,'question',E'다음 중 빈칸에 들어갈 말로 알맞지 않은 것은? (단, 순서는 상관없음)\n• She burst into tears. Because ___.\n• He couldn''t stop laughing. Because ___.\n• They ran out of the building. Because ___.\n• She hugged her mom tightly. Because ___.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'the joke was so funny',E'she hadn''t seen her mom in two years',E'she got a standing ovation',E'she received terrible news',E'the fire alarm suddenly went off'),'answer',E'3'),
