    jsonb_build_object('number',32,'question',E'다음 두 문장의 연결이 의미상 어색한 것은?\n① She set three alarms. She was afraid of oversleeping.\n   → She set three alarms because she was afraid of oversleeping.\n② He apologized to her. He hurt her feelings.\n   → He apologized to her because he hurt her feelings.\n③ She donated her savings. She had more money than ever.\n   → She donated her savings because she had more money than ever.\n④ I put on sunscreen. The UV index was extremely high.\n   → I put on sunscreen because the UV index was extremely high.\n⑤ He wore gloves. His hands got frostbite last winter.\n   → He wore gloves because his hands got frostbite last winter.','type','mcq','options',jsonb_build_array(E'She set three alarms because she was afraid of oversleeping.',E'He apologized to her because he hurt her feelings.',E'She donated her savings because she had more money than ever.',E'I put on sunscreen because the UV index was extremely high.',E'He wore gloves because his hands got frostbite last winter.'),'answer',E'3'),
